{"label_alt_en":["\"des référés\""],"label_alt_fr":["Procédure : „des référés”","„des référés”"],"broader":[{"id":"facet.procedure","type":"theme","pref_fr":"Procédure","pref_en":"Procedure","is_facet":true}],"id":"c.procedure-by-way-of-refere","issues":[],"pages":[186],"pref_en":"Procedure by way of référé","pref_fr":"Procédure de référé","printed":["t.procedure.des-referes"],"related":[{"id":"c.fernandes-amendments-on-interdicts","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Amendements de Fernandes sur la procédure des interdits","pref_en":"Fernandes's amendments on the procedure of interdicts","is_facet":null}],"label_scope_note_en":"The Committee considered a summary procedure for urgent or provisional relief.","type":"concept","direct_count":1,"propagated_count":1,"breadcrumb_paths":[[{"id":"facet.procedure","type":"theme","pref_fr":"Procédure","pref_en":"Procedure","is_facet":true},{"id":"c.procedure-by-way-of-refere","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Procédure de référé","pref_en":"Procedure by way of référé","is_facet":null}]],"narrower":[],"printed_entries":[{"entries":[{"article_ref":null,"label_heading":"Procédure","id":"fr.0148.02","lang":"fr","qualifier":null,"raw":"Procédure: du Comité 21, 22/5, 31, 101, 102, 113 (texte), 117, 140, 155, 167, 175, 190, 246/8, 262, 270, 281, 341, 383, 386, 439, 451, 475; „des référés” 176; des „demurrers” 320.","refs":[{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":186,"printed":176,"raw":"176","seq":false}],"see":[],"source_pdf":779,"sub":"„des référés”"},{"article_ref":null,"label_heading":"Procedure","id":"en.0157.01","lang":"en","qualifier":null,"raw":"\"des référés\" 176; of \"demurrers\", 320; of Committee 21, 22/5, 31, 101, 102, 113 (text), 117, 140, 155, 167, 175, 190, 246/8, 262, 270, 281, 341, 383, 386, 439, 451, 475; general 18; summary 28, 173, 176, 187, 516, 619/20, 647, 719, 754; to bring a case before the Court 227, 734/5; of the Court 28, 44, 186, 213, 241, 247, 307, 339, 608/9, 620; written or oral 736/7.","refs":[{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":186,"printed":176,"raw":"176","seq":false}],"see":[],"source_pdf":785,"sub":"\"des référés\""}],"id":"t.procedure.des-referes","label_en":"\"des référés\"","label_fr":"„des référés”","n_pages":1,"pages":[186],"parent":"t.procedure","printed_en_id":"en.0157.01","printed_fr_id":"fr.0148.02","see":[],"type":"sub"}],"groups":[{"meeting":7,"section":"7","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0186.07","meeting":7,"doc":"minutes","pdf":186,"printed":176,"texts":{"fr":"… peut parer au besoin d'une procédure sommaire en conférant au Président ou à un membre de la Cour le droit de prendre, seul, des décisions en cas d'urgence; ce système existe en France. M. de Lapradelle fait allusion à la procédure des référés: les parties peuvent, en s'adressant à la Cour, spécifier que le Président, ou un juge désigné par lui, décidera seul.","en":"…t one could meet the need for a summary procedure by conferring on the President or a member of the Court the right to make decisions alone in urgent cases. This system existed in France. M. de Lapradelle mentioned the \"procédure des référés\". The parties may, when putting the case before the Court, specify that the President or a judge appointed by him shall decide the case by himself.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0186.07","speaker_id":"lapradelle","certain":true,"name":"Albert de Geouffre de Lapradelle","role":"member"},"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.procedure-by-way-of-refere","weight":1.0,"end":292,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":1046,"start":221},{"concept":"c.procedure-by-way-of-refere","weight":1.0,"end":245,"label":"Procédure : „des référés”","lang":"fr","start":224},{"concept":"c.procedure-by-way-of-refere","weight":1.0,"end":245,"label":"„des référés”","lang":"fr","start":234},{"concept":"c.procedure-by-way-of-refere","weight":1.0,"end":242,"label":"Procédure : „des référés”","lang":"en","start":221},{"concept":"c.procedure-by-way-of-refere","weight":1.0,"end":242,"label":"„des référés”","lang":"en","s